{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"附錄[一]唯識三十論","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"由假說我法　有種種相轉.彼依識所變。此能變唯三.","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"謂異熟.思量.及了別境識。初阿賴耶識.異熟.一切種.","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"不可知執受　處了.常與觸　作意受想思相應.唯捨受.","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"是無覆無記.觸等亦如是.恆轉如暴流.阿羅漢位捨。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"次第二能變.是識名末那.依彼轉.緣彼.思量爲性相.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"四煩惱常俱　謂我癡我見並我慢我愛.及餘觸等俱.","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"有覆無記攝.隨所生所繫.阿羅漢滅定　出世道無有。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"次第三能變差別有六種.了境爲性相.善不善俱非.","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"此心所徧行.別境.善.煩惱.　隨煩惱.不定.三受共相應.","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"初徧行觸等.次別境謂欲　勝解念定慧所緣事不同.","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"善謂信慚愧　無貪等三根勤安不放逸行捨及不害.","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"[一]宋麗元明各藏均載玄奘所譯唯識三十論一種.頌文而外兼出長行科段.勘","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"西藏譯三十論及梵本安慧論釋.世親本論原無長行.玄奘所譯乃從護法等釋節","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"出.而題爲世親菩薩造.殊悖體製.今不從.但錄頌文以便讀釋.","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"煩惱謂貪瞋癡慢疑惡見.　隨煩惱謂忿恨覆惱嫉慳","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"誑諂與害憍無慚及無愧掉擧與惛沈不信並懈怠","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"放逸及失念散亂不正知.　不定謂悔眠尋伺二各二.","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"依止根本識五識隨緣現.　或俱或不俱如濤波依水.","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"意識常現起除生無想天及無心二定睡眠與悶絕。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"是諸識轉變分別所分別由此彼皆無.　故一切唯識。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"由一切種識如是如是變.　以展轉力故彼彼分別生。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"由諸業習氣二取習氣俱.　前異熟旣盡復生餘異熟。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"由彼彼徧計徧計種種物.　此徧計所執自性無所有。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"依他起自性分別.緣所生。圓成實於彼常遠離前性.","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"故此與依他非異非不異.　如無常等性.　非不見此彼。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"卽依此三性立彼三無性.　故佛密意說一切法無性。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"初卽相無性.　次無自然性.　後由遠離前所執我法性.","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"此諸法勝義.　亦卽是真如.　常如其性故.　卽唯識實性。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"乃至未起識求住唯識性.　於二取隨眠猶未能伏滅。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"現前立少物謂是唯識性.　以有所得故非實住唯識。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"若時於所緣智都無所得.　爾時住唯識.　離二取相故。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"無得.不思議.　是出世間智.　捨二麤重故便證得轉依。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_203_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_203","text":"此卽無漏界.　不思議.善.常.安樂.解脫身.　大牟尼名法。","sortOrder":37}],"overrides":{}}